# A folder that is folded shows ">" before its name and a file shows nothing: the
# glyph ">" is 18 pixels in Unscii and sits in the cell at x = 8 to 16. The file "a.txt"
# is the second row, y 22 to 44.
# files a.txt=A
# files sub/b.txt=B
# open a.txt
# frames 4
# pixels 8 0 16 22 223 225 230 18
# pixels 8 22 16 44 223 225 230 none
1 key b ctrl
